d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183450/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1713748701\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183450/extras/408bb3c67bb4ed996bd830794ff37003.avif?t=1713748701\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183450/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1713748701\" /></div><br><br>The game will have multiple world, each with several levels,<br>Each world will have a boss fight, yielding a shard of pearl or full pearl.<br>While unlocking new powers, some levels have new areas reachable.<br>Are you up for the task? Wishlist now!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183450/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1713748701\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183450/extras/0d40d3b9ddd60ab940fb7588d6d61edf.avif?t=1713748701\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2183450/extras/fdc56072dbcc1e0f70ad048f7b37c74c.webp?t=1713748701\" /></div>",
